# An attacking creature is usually tapped as well, but the reduction applies once (CR 601.2f): Bot2's Llanowar Elves are both
# attacking and tapped on turn 4, and Bot1's three Moxen pay {2}{U} with nothing left floating. Bot2 chooses the bottom.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Dire Downdraft
Island
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot1)
? Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Tapped = true
Bot2.Pass
